            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_eb75a8d8">
               <titlePage label="Title on printed folio" xml:id="titlePage_8a3a3394">
                  <p xml:id="idm36">Lied der Preußen | an die | Keyserinn=Königinn, | nach | Wiedereroberung der Stadt | Breslau, | am 19 Dec. 1757. | ___ |</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_47eb2afa">1 bifolio</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_ce29e1c3">16.4x11.7</dimensions>
               <watermark xml:id="watermark_82a08fde">no visible watermark.</watermark>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_f5b05a2f">In 4<rend xml:id="idm41" rend="sup">o</rend>; oblong format consisting of a cropped bifolio; music (fols. 1r–2r), blank page with staves, printed sheet; in all a single bifolio. Hand-ruled paper, 10 staves on fols. 1v–2r and 11 staves on fols. 1r–2v (7 mm; single or possibly a double rastrum used) in light brown ink and music in black ink. A clean copy with a single cancellation and few corrections in ink. Bound with a printed sheet (fol. 3), possibly from a printed pamphlet though there are no page numbers; with text to song no. 3 (SchW B5:172). The printed sheet corresponds to <rend xml:id="idm42" fontstyle="italic">Preussische Kriegslieder in den Feldzügen 1756 und 1757</rend> (Berlin, 1758), pp. 131–34, though type-setting and spelling indicates a different edition or printer, probably a later edition.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
